      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T13:30:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suggestion: \"kCodec\" is a bit too vague. To contrast it with kScanline, maybe kGetAllPixels.\n\nMaybe kScanline is too jargony (or perhaps refers to implementation details/old API names), and we could rename it to kIncrementalDecode.\n\nOk, as long as we are renaming the other two, we could simply call it kZeroInit since that Codec word doesn\u0027t really seem information-carrying.",
