      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T13:30:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think uninteresting is too vague. It may mean unsupported or \"previously unsupported\" [1], or \"meaningless\" and I think we should endeavor to be more precise where we can be.\n\n[1] https://codereview.chromium.org/1704433003\n\nFailing loudly sgtm",
